  "details": "I'm a big fan of the way the avatars are displayed now but I would like and I know others would like this to be able to set default sorting (or can be set) to when you uploaded them. \nCurrently in live it will display them by time of upload. This is great as not a lot of people wanna scroll through to get to their new or out of date avatars. \nFor example my avatars under recently used, last updated and title all show YEARS old avatars which are barely ever used anymore.\nSo yeah sorting by when uploaded would be a nice addition.",
